* 主变量 local (替换占位符 → main spec)
* ============================================================================
* V5 / st-table2-main-04 fix (2026-06-03); correctness-04 升级 (2026-06-03):
*   full-text track 在面板中是裸名 tech_frac / symb_frac (无 _lf / _sf 后缀);
*   ctx track 才是 tech_frac_lc / symb_frac_sc. 当 main spec 选 full 轨
*   (MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK=lf / MAIN_SUBST_TRACK=sf, 见 stata_runner.py:206
*   _VALID_SPEC_VALUES = {lf,lc} × {sf,sc}) 时, 早期 `tech_frac_<track>` 直拼会展开成
*   tech_frac_lf / symb_frac_sf — 这两列在面板中不存在 (幻影列), M4/M6 的 reghdfe
*   引用它们会 r(111) 整张 Table 2 崩 (full 轨数据其实以裸名存在, 只是无 _lf/_sf 后缀).
*   correctness-04: 不再丢控制 degrade, 而是把幻影 _lf/_sf 重映射到真实存在的裸名 —
*   lf → 裸名 tech_frac, sf → 裸名 symb_frac; lc → tech_frac_lc, sc → symb_frac_sc.
*   占位符在 instantiate 时被替换成字面量 lf/lc/sf/sc, 下面用字符串比较选列名.
*   保留 capture confirm 作二次兜底: 即使映射后列仍缺 (面板未物化) 也 degrade 不崩.
* ============================================================================
local DV     llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

* LOCUS: lf (full) → 裸名 tech_frac; lc (ctx) → tech_frac_lc
if "{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}" == "lf" {
    local LOCUS tech_frac
}
else {
    local LOCUS tech_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}
}

* SUBST: sf (full) → 裸名 symb_frac; sc (ctx) → symb_frac_sc
if "{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}" == "sf" {
    local SUBST symb_frac
}
else {
    local SUBST symb_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}
}

* LOCUS/SUBST 存在性守卫 (V5 防 r(111); 重映射后的二次兜底)
capture confirm variable `LOCUS' `SUBST'
if _rc {
    display "  ⚠️ LOCUS/SUBST 列缺 (`LOCUS' / `SUBST'): 重映射后仍未物化, M4-M6 degrade 为不含 LOCUS/SUBST 的回归"
    local LOCUS
    local SUBST
}

* M1: 仅 digital_frontier (主解释)
eststo M1: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier, noabsorb vce(cluster bank_id)

* M2: + Bank FE
eststo M2: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier, absorb(bank_id) vce(cluster bank_id)

* M3: + Bank FE + Year FE
eststo M3: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier, absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)

* M4: + locus / subst 占比控制
eststo M4: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)

* M5: + bank 属性控制
capture confirm variable bank_size bank_age
if !_rc {
    eststo M5: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `LOCUS' `SUBST' bank_size bank_age, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ bank_size/bank_age 不存在, M5 跳过"
    eststo M5: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}

* M6: + 交互项 (LOCUS × SUBST)
* V5 守卫: LOCUS/SUBST 均存在才加 c.#c. 交互 (缺列时已被上方 local 置空,
* 此时退化为 M5 同规格主回归, 避免 `c.#c.` 空宏语法错).
if "`LOCUS'" != "" & "`SUBST'" != "" {
    eststo M6: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `LOCUS' `SUBST' c.`LOCUS'#c.`SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ LOCUS/SUBST 缺列, M6 交互项跳过, degrade 为主回归 (digital_frontier only)"
    eststo M6: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}

* ============================================================================
* M7 (FE-ROBUST IDENTIFICATION, D1-digital_frontier fix 2026-06-16):
*   ⚠ 核心识别披露: digital_frontier 是【基年、银行内时间不变】的 0/1 银行分类
*   (base-year within-bank time-invariant)。在 absorb(bank_id ...) 的列 (M2-M6)
*   里它与银行固定效应【完全共线】→ reghdfe 静默 drop, 其系数【无法识别】, 这些列
*   真正识别的是银行内随时间变动的项 (LOCUS/SUBST 控制)。digital_frontier 的主效应
*   仅在【无吸收】列 M1 (noabsorb) 中被识别。
*   为在 bank-FE 设定下仍恢复"数字化前沿"的可识别信号, 这里补一列银行内随时间变动
*   形式 c.digital_frontier##i.year (交乘项【不会】被 bank FE 吸收, 基年自动省略),
*   读各年相对基年的 digital_frontier × year 微分效应 — 镜像 34_tableA11 Panel B 的
*   c.`EXPL'##i.era ... absorb(bank_id year) 工作模式, 但按年 (i.year) 而非按时代。
* 白话: "数字化前沿"是一家银行的固定标签 (基年定、之后不变), 一旦放进"按银行去均值"
*   的固定效应里就被吃光、看不到系数了 (M2-M6 那一行其实是空的, 只有 M1 那列真有它);
*   所以这里换个写法——让它和年份相乘, 看"前沿银行在不同年份相对基年的语调差", 这个
*   交乘项不会被银行固定效应吸收, 在带银行 FE 的设定里照样能识别。
* 守卫: year 必须存在且 ≥2 取值, 交乘列才有意义; 缺/单年时优雅跳过 (早期试跑 T=2 盘可跑,
*   但只有一个非基年交乘项)。capture noisily 包裹, 缺列/退化绝不 r(111) 中断本表。
* ============================================================================
capture confirm variable year
if !_rc {
    quietly levelsof year, local(_yrs_m7)
    local _ny_m7 : word count `_yrs_m7'
    if `_ny_m7' >= 2 {
        capture noisily eststo M7: reghdfe `DV' c.digital_frontier##i.year `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
        if _rc {
            display "  ⚠️ M7 (c.digital_frontier##i.year FE-robust) 回归退化 (rc=`=_rc'), 跳过 — 不影响 M1-M6"
        }
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ M7 跳过: year 仅 `_ny_m7' 个取值 (需 ≥2 才有交乘变异); 全量 T=19 下有功效"
    }
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ M7 跳过: year 不在面板, 无法构造 c.digital_frontier##i.year"
}

* 输出 Table 2 (booktabs LaTeX)
* ⚠ SPEC IV-3 (descriptive-placeholder): 本表方程是 tone ~ digital_frontier
*   (tone 作 DV), 与 paper_spec 主识别方向相反 (spec: funding_cost ~ tone)。在财务
*   面板 (funding_cost) 接入前, 本表仅是占位的描述性关联, 不是论文的 confirmatory
*   Main Results。标题/脚注显式标注 DESCRIPTIVE PLACEHOLDER, 防外部研究者误引。
*   财务列落地后须重写为 funding_cost ~ {MAIN_TREAT} 正向方程。
* fix(D1-digital_frontier, 2026-06-16): 列名动态化 — M1-M6 始终在; M7 (FE-robust
* c.digital_frontier##i.year) 仅在实际 eststo 存储时才追加 (year 缺/单年/退化时跳过),
* 沿用 13_table4/21_tableA2/24_tableA5 的 `list m in stored` 动态名单 idiom, 避免硬点名
* 缺失估计 r(111) 丢整表。M1-M6 不删、不改, M7 只是额外补列。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cols    M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6
local coltits `""M1" "M2" "M3" "M4" "M5" "M6""'
if `: list M7 in stored' {
    local cols    `cols' M7
    local coltits `"`coltits' "M7 (FE-robust x year)""'
}

esttab `cols' using "output/tables/table2_main.tex", ///
    se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) ///
    booktabs replace fragment ///
    title("Table 2 [DESCRIPTIVE PLACEHOLDER — NOT confirmatory main results]: Bank Fintech Tone (M1-M6)") ///
    mtitles(`coltits') ///
    note("DESCRIPTIVE PLACEHOLDER, do NOT cite as Main Results. This table runs tone ~ digital_frontier (tone as DV), the REVERSE of the paper_spec primary identification (funding_cost ~ tone). It holds the Table 2 slot until the financial panel (funding_cost) is merged (M0.5.11 enrichment), after which it must be rewritten in the forward direction. " ///
         "IDENTIFICATION NOTE: digital_frontier is a base-year within-bank time-invariant 0/1 classifier, so beta(digital_frontier) is identified ONLY in the no-absorb column M1; in the bank-FE columns (M2-M6) it is collinear with the bank fixed effect and absorbed (silently dropped), so those columns identify the within-bank time-varying terms (LOCUS/SUBST controls), not the frontier main effect. Column M7 recovers an FE-robust form by interacting c.digital_frontier with i.year (interaction terms are NOT absorbed; base year omitted). " ///
         "Robust SEs clustered at bank level. Main spec: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}, subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}, sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}.")

* fix(omni-g-esttab-csv, 2026-06-11): CSV side-channel (与 .tex 同模型同统计规格) —
* 供 python 侧 papers/_common/stata_postprocess.parse_esttab_csv 消费。
* 用 estout + delimiter(",") 而非 esttab csv: esttab csv 默认 ="..." Excel 包裹
* (plain 则丢 SE 括号), 两者都破坏 parse_esttab_csv 的 (se) 行正则。
estout `cols' using "output/tables/table2_main.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
    starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) ///
    mlabels(`coltits')

display "✅ Table 2 written to output/tables/table2_main.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"
